 bear the burden of knowledge.<br>The fate of the universe may rest on your furr.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you learn to bear?</strong> 🐻</p>", "short_description": "Play as Agent Furr in a surreal 3D platformer of movement, puzzles, and chaos. Traverse 40+ levels, unlock abilities, and unravel dreamlike challenges to assemble the mystical Enochian Cube and confront the final boss. No handholding—just you and your paws.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789890/header.jpg?t=1747050965", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789890/83986474a48919b1a77fb97aab6ade02f8993417/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747050965", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789890/83986474a48919b1a77fb97aab6ade02f8993417/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747050965", "website": "https://www.youtube.com/@LearningToBear", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4460 / AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 960 / AMD Radeon R9 380 (2GB VRAM, DX12 support)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX compatible<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> -<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> These system requirements can't cover all possible configurations. Performance may vary depending on your system.</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating sy